3. LAPACK and BLAS (netlib) -- BSD 3-Clause

MOPAC 7 bundles fifteen netlib reference routines, which are compiled into the
WebAssembly module: dgemm, dgemv, dger, dtrmm, dtrmv, dtrsm, lsame and xerbla
(BLAS), and dgetf2, dgetrf, dgetri, dlaswp, dtrti2, dtrtri and ilaenv, each of
which carries the header "LAPACK ROUTINE (VERSION 1.0B)" and a 1992 date. The
bundled copies carry no licence header; netlib distributes LAPACK and the
reference BLAS under the BSD 3-Clause licence
(https://www.netlib.org/lapack/LICENSE.txt), with the three-clause text above
and these copyright holders:

Copyright (c) 1992-2013 The University of Tennessee and The University of
                        Tennessee Research Foundation.  All rights reserved.
Copyright (c) 2000-2013 The University of California Berkeley. All rights
                        reserved.
Copyright (c) 2006-2013 The University of Colorado Denver.  All rights
                        reserved.

